## Third-party material — NOT covered by the above

### QASPER corpus

Not redistributed in this package. Distributed by the Allen Institute for AI
under its own terms. `data/qasper_reference/eligible_ids.jsonl` contains
identifiers and cohort metadata only, never corpus text.

### Model weights

Not redistributed. Each model is pinned to an exact commit SHA in
`materials/models.json`, which also records the
license as stated on each model's Hub card:

| model | stated license | note |
|---|---|---|
| `cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2` | apache-2.0 | |
| `BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3` | apache-2.0 | |
| `BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-gemma` | apache-2.0 | Base model is Gemma; Gemma Terms of Use apply to the weights. Only rankings produced by the model are included here, not weights. |
| `Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B` | apache-2.0 | |
| `rryisthebest/First_Model` | mit | |
| `liuwenhan/ReasonRank-7B` | mit | |

### Judge models

`gpt-4o` and `gpt-5-2025-08-07` are accessed as a paid API service under OpenAI's
terms. No model weights or API credentials are included. Nothing in this package
contacts any API.
